{"classification":"mathematical-wrong-sequence-family","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0025","math_ordinal":235,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The construction immediately above proves that every G'_n contains E and that mu(G'_n minus E) tends to zero. The unprimed G_n contain only E_n and need not contain E, so their intersection cannot support the stated conclusion; H_2 must be the intersection of the primed tail unions.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt1.2011/mt134.tex:405","source_normalized_sha256":"284f0429548de1a689fbdbef6e0e66856f4cb294b93376a3da75e86eea7ada28","source_text":"H_2=\\bigcap_{n\\in\\Bbb N}G_n","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt134.tex:402","target_normalized_sha256":"e123d2549d0efe1726cda610bfd69fe733bd233a7b446831590b91d4c4092f5e","target_text":"H_2=\\bigcap_{n\\in\\Bbb N}G'_n","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V1-S134"}
{"classification":"mathematical-undefined-measure-variable","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0026","math_ordinal":570,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The entire proposition and both Darboux estimates use Lebesgue measure mu; nu is never introduced in this argument. Replacing the undefined nu with mu restores the equality between the lower Lebesgue integral and the Riemann integral established by the surrounding inequalities.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt1.2011/mt134.tex:849","source_normalized_sha256":"a5214fb8a72e3f6399a8225574019a2a7c8ba00d2a082bf6a70172fc97eaebb4","source_text":"\\underline{\\int}fd\\nu","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt134.tex:840","target_normalized_sha256":"744ddbee5b42faacbd73152c08ed07923f65944a192078a4c7776b621887bc48","target_text":"\\underline{\\int}fd\\mu","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V1-S134"}
